---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Delete Rumo Pragas data — Privacy"
  description="How to request deletion of Rumo Pragas app data and understand the processing result."
  canonical="https://pragas.agrorumo.com/delete-account"
  lang="en"
  uiLang="pt-BR"
  ogLocale="en_US"
  ogImageAlt="Rumo Pragas: photo-based hypotheses, confidence, alternatives, and integrated pest management content"
>
  <Header lang="pt-BR" />
  <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-16 pt-28 prose md:pt-32">
    <h1>Delete your Rumo Pragas data</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> July 14, 2026</p>
    <p>This page is also available in Portuguese: <a href="/excluir-conta" lang="pt-BR">Excluir dados do Rumo Pragas</a>.</p>
    <p>
      This action deletes data specific to the Rumo Pragas app. Your AgroRumo sign-in identity is shared
      with other products and is not deleted by this app-specific operation.
    </p>

    <h2>Delete through the app</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open Rumo Pragas on iPhone or Android.</li>
      <li>Open the <strong>Settings</strong> tab.</li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Delete Account</strong>.</li>
      <li>Read the notice and confirm.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Understand the result</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Completed:</strong> Rumo Pragas app data was deleted and push tokens were revoked. The global AgroRumo identity, shared historical records without a safe app discriminator, and the minimum unlink marker were retained.</li>
      <li><strong>Processing:</strong> the request was accepted but has not finished. Wait and check again.</li>
      <li><strong>Not completed:</strong> the operation failed or is incomplete. Retry it and contact support if the issue persists.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Completed deletion is irreversible for Rumo Pragas data. Records may be retained where required by
      law, for the exercise of legal rights, or under another lawful retention basis.
    </p>

    <h2>Data covered</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>saved Rumo Pragas identification history and results;</li>
      <li>app-specific interactions and preferences;</li>
      <li>auxiliary records linked to Rumo Pragas usage;</li>
      <li>push-notification tokens associated with the app.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The current history record stores the structured result without writing an image URL. Images kept
      in your device gallery must be deleted through your device.
    </p>

    <h2>Global AgroRumo identity</h2>
    <p>
      Your name, email and authentication identity may support other AgroRumo products and therefore may
      be retained under the applicable lawful basis. To exercise rights over the global identity, contact
      our privacy channel; the request will be assessed across the relevant products and legal retention
      requirements.
    </p>
    <p>
      Historical analytics and audit events that cannot be safely attributed to one app are also retained,
      because deleting them could alter records belonging to other AgroRumo products.
    </p>

    <h2>Minimum unlink marker</h2>
    <p>
      To finish retries and prevent Rumo Pragas data from being silently recreated, we retain only the
      global identity UUID, operational status, attempt count, limited technical error codes and processing
      timestamps. It contains no name, email, photo, message, content or token and is not used for
      advertising or profiling.
    </p>
    <p>
      Its purposes are to perform the request, prove app-specific cleanup and honor the unlink state. As
      applicable, processing is based on fulfilling the data-subject request, data-protection obligations
      and the establishment or exercise of legal rights. It remains until you explicitly reactivate Rumo
      Pragas or the global AgroRumo identity is deleted. Reactivation does not restore old data.
    </p>

    <h2>Assisted request</h2>
    <p>
      If you cannot access the app, email
      <a href="mailto:contato@agrorumo.com?subject=Delete%20Rumo%20Pragas%20Data">contato@agrorumo.com</a>
      from your registered address and request deletion of your Rumo Pragas data. We may request the
      minimum information necessary to verify your identity and protect the account.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>Privacy contact: <a href="mailto:contato@agrorumo.com">contato@agrorumo.com</a> · <a href="/privacidade">Privacy Policy</a></p>

    <hr />
    <p><small>MM CAMPO FORTE LTDA. · CNPJ 57.169.838/0001-20 · Brazil · LGPD (Law 13.709/2018)</small></p>
  </main>
  <Footer lang="pt-BR" />
</BaseLayout>
